  "question": {
    "text": "Let for some real numbers <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>&#946;</mi></math>. If the system of equations <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mi>i</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>8</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>sin</mi><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;has more than one solution then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>&#946;</mi></mfrac></math>&nbsp;is equal to",
    "image": null
